n is flagged for human review. The strategy has no Prerequisites & Process Gates section declaring documentation support, but HLR-4 explicitly requires documentation and E008 (docs-authoring) satisfies Rule 11 regardless.\n48\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9f44ae4266dcc850","agent_id":"aa645b06e56a9bd69","session_id":"51e94c62-f637-4718-aadc-0000f673a195","uuid":"9e5c322c-fe97-402b-95b6-23e1af0039b2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:31:03.019Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8b1f1258f519288","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Revise RHAISTRAT-9006 decomposition"}
