dpoint succeed. This\n53\t  verification may run against an ephemeral or test Feast endpoint (for\n54\t  example, a temporary `feast serve` instance reachable from the session);\n55\t  availability of a productized Feature Store endpoint is not a prerequisite\n56\t  for this epic, since the deployment topology is decided separately.\n57\t\n58\t## HLR Traceability\n59\t\n60\t- HLR-2: data scientists can reach the feature store from workbenches with the\n61\t  Feast SDK preinstalled in at least one supported workbench image.\n62\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3868c449c31b27c","agent_id":"a954cbc11de1413ef","session_id":"51e94c62-f637-4718-aadc-0000f673a195","uuid":"547fa990-9fdc-4e68-b83e-29074dd2d8b2","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:29.102Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9ed24cd30d59201f","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9006 after revision"}
