ints for each project, reading the\n51\t  resource/endpoint surface of the deployment topology selected by the topology\n52\t  decision.\n53\t- Hide the Feature Store when it is not enabled.\n54\t\n55\t## Acceptance Criteria\n56\t\n57\t- When the Feature Store is enabled, the Dashboard shows it as an enabled\n58\t  component, per project.\n59\t- The Dashboard links users to the Feature Store endpoints that exist for that\n60\t  project under the selected topology.\n61\t- When the Feature Store is not enabled, it is not shown.\n62\t- No feature-authoring UI is introduced — navigation is link-out only,\n63\t  respecting the strategy's out-of-scope boundary.\n64\t\n65\t## HLR Traceability\n66\t\n67\t- HLR-3: the Dashboard shows the Feature Store as an enabled component and\n68\t  links users to its endpoints per project.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3868c449c31b27c","agent_id":"a954cbc11de1413ef","session_id":"51e94c62-f637-4718-aadc-0000f673a195","uuid":"1fddd5f3-eef2-48d7-a827-98a7c7dd34b7","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:30.354Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-af8dd762bdf50fdb","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9006 after revision"}
