nts as\n51\t  determined by the topology decision record.\n52\t- Provide install, upgrade, and rollback paths consistent with the\n53\t  operator-based model.\n54\t- Ensure the deployment's custom resources and endpoints are discoverable for\n55\t  platform integration (operator enablement and Dashboard link-out).\n56\t\n57\t## Acceptance Criteria\n58\t\n59\t- The operator-based Feast deployment installs from the productized packaging\n60\t  in the midstream repository.\n61\t- The deployment is reachable per project as specified in the topology decision\n62\t  record.\n63\t- An upgrade from the previous productized version (or the initial pinned\n64\t  upstream version) completes successfully.\n65\t- The productized images build green in the platform build pipeline.\n66\t- The custom resources and endpoints the deployment exposes are documented for\n67\t  the Platform Operator and Dashboard integrations.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-1: the supported, installable Feature Store with productized images,\n72\t  delivered via the operator-based topology.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b3868c449c31b27c","agent_id":"a954cbc11de1413ef","session_id":"51e94c62-f637-4718-aadc-0000f673a195","uuid":"a594882d-ccc2-4565-989a-8ded7984484e","timestamp":"2026-10-22T16:32:36.226Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-92883e48d1a1d4e7","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9006 after revision"}
